[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140] STEP PURPOSE
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   Step 140: Astrometric-catalogue stratification (step_b104).
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   The era transition near 2018 coincides with the astrometric
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   reduction-catalogue switch (UCAC4-era -> Gaia-DR era reductions) in
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   the MPC observation stream.  Step 130 showed the signature
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   transition tracks perihelion epoch rather than source table, but a
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   reduction systematic applied per-observation would also track
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   perihelion epoch -- the confound was narrowed, not closed.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   This step stratifies directly on the per-observation astcat field
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   of the cached MPC ADES observations:
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   GAIA-ERA   = {Gaia1, Gaia2, Gaia3, Gaia3E, ATLAS2}  -- ATLAS2 is
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   the Gaia-derived ATLAS-REFCAT2, same reduction epoch
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   LEGACY     = {UCAC*, USNO*, GSC*, NOMAD, PPMXL, URAT1, 2MASS,
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   ACT, UNK, ...}
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   For every dual-leg refit record the Gaia-era fraction is computed
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   per leg (inbound = pre-perihelion obs, outbound = post-perihelion
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   obs, split at the comet's tp_jd), giving each comet a leg-level
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   reduction-composition profile independent of its source table.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   Tests
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   T1  composition summary: leg Gaia fractions by cohort (pre-2018
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   vs post-2017 refits) -- quantifies how mixed the legs are.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   T2  uniform-modern-legs control (post-2017 cohort): the
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   displaced-cap contrast on the carrier channels (d_out_leg,
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   ddirf) restricted to comets whose BOTH legs are >=70%
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   Gaia-era reductions.  A reduction-switch artifact cannot
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   survive a leg-uniform cut -- both legs were reduced in the
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   same system.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   T3  uniform-legacy-legs control (pre-2018 cohort): the
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   declared-cap contrast on the carrier channel (d_in_leg)
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   restricted to comets whose both legs are <=30% Gaia-era.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   The registered anomaly on pre-Gaia reductions demonstrates
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   it predates the switch rather than being created by it.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   T4  composition-vs-signal association: Spearman of the leg-fit
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   disagreement (ddirf) against the minimum leg Gaia fraction,
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   per cohort and cap -- under the systematic the signal
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   should scale with composition.
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   T5  era crossers: pre-2018-table comets whose perihelia fall
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   after 2018 -- does their signature track their leg
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   composition or their transit epoch?
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   Selection rules, sample sizes, null model and seeds are reported
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   in the result leaf; missing astcat counts toward LEGACY (the
[2026-09-20 12:25:29 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 140]   pre-catalog-era default).
